  "description": "An MCP server and CLI tool for AI agent memory storage and semantic search. Enables agents to save, share, and search memories using hybrid search (BM25 + vector embeddings via all-MiniLM-L6-v2), merged with Reciprocal Rank Fusion. Built with .NET 10 and SQLite -- standalone with no external service dependencies.",
  "id": "Zakira.Exchange",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-07T17:00:44.407Z",
