  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.1 -- hotfix: bundle the all-MiniLM-L6-v2 ONNX model and vocab.txt with the package. 0.3.0 was packed on a build machine that hadn't downloaded the model files, so the conditional `<ItemGroup Condition=\"Exists(...)\">` in Core.csproj silently dropped them and any environment without a pre-existing model copy hit FileNotFoundException on the first Create/Edit/Search call. No code changes from 0.3.0; pack.ps1 now refuses to pack without the model files unless -AllowMissingModel is passed.",
